{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00424",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.63,
      "end_seconds": 3.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Good morning, how are you doing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.91,
      "end_seconds": 5.61,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hello."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.23,
      "end_seconds": 11.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "What was the main thing you wanted to talk about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.32,
      "end_seconds": 18.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got pimples on my face."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.8,
      "end_seconds": 21.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.58,
      "end_seconds": 22.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.57,
      "end_seconds": 26.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Roughly when did it start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.76,
      "end_seconds": 34.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Oh, it's been about a month now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.75,
      "end_seconds": 38.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.94,
      "end_seconds": 43.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "A six out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.58,
      "end_seconds": 48.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Does anything bring it on or make it worse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.34,
      "end_seconds": 76.61,
      "duration_seconds": 27.27,
      "text": "Oh, uh, I notice it more with stress and oily food. Oh, uh, and flare-ups before my period. As for flare-ups before my period, it's moderate, honestly. I've had painful lumps on the chin too, for about three months. As for painful lumps on the chin, a six out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.88,
      "end_seconds": 83.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "Have you had pimples on your face before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.62,
      "end_seconds": 91.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "I had a similar thing a couple of years ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.91,
      "end_seconds": 97.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Have you had any excess hair growth or pregnancy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.89,
      "end_seconds": 103.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "No, uh, not any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.98,
      "end_seconds": 109.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Okay, so. Have you had any new face cream or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.89,
      "end_seconds": 119.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "No new face cream or fever, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.02,
      "end_seconds": 124.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.82,
      "end_seconds": 130.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.95,
      "end_seconds": 135.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.35,
      "end_seconds": 142.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.46,
      "end_seconds": 147.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.33,
      "end_seconds": 152.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "No, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.27,
      "end_seconds": 156.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Is anyone at home with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.06,
      "end_seconds": 160.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I share a flat with two friends."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.22,
      "end_seconds": 164.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Do you have a job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.31,
      "end_seconds": 169.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "I'm a self-employed electrician."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.98,
      "end_seconds": 173.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Are you active at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.12,
      "end_seconds": 179.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Barely, I'm mostly sedentary these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.53,
      "end_seconds": 200.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Any drug or food allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.39,
      "end_seconds": 209.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "Oh, years back I got stomach pain from ibuprofen, so I stay away from it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.3,
      "end_seconds": 213.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.61,
      "end_seconds": 223.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.65,
      "end_seconds": 257.2,
      "duration_seconds": 16.55,
      "text": "Okay: height 182 centimetres, BMI works out to 21.1, heart rate 64, respiratory rate 17, temperature 36.5, pressure 121 over 74, weight 70 kilos, SpO2 99 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.18,
      "end_seconds": 261.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.3,
      "end_seconds": 266.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Let's look at it together in a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.27,
      "end_seconds": 271.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "I'd like to examine you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.09,
      "end_seconds": 274.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Let me look at this properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.78,
      "end_seconds": 298.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "There are red papules and a few pustules over the cheeks and chin, with some blackheads."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.18,
      "end_seconds": 303.08,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Okay, finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.21,
      "end_seconds": 320.2,
      "duration_seconds": 9.99,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with moderate acne at this stage. We shouldn't forget a hormonal cause."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.94,
      "end_seconds": 324.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "What are the chances it's something bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.2,
      "end_seconds": 353.65,
      "duration_seconds": 27.45,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like moderate acne. The treatment will be adapalene gel, at night, for eight weeks. It's for acne. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. It takes six to eight weeks to see the difference, so please don't give up in the first fortnight."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.53,
      "end_seconds": 369.42,
      "duration_seconds": 14.89,
      "text": "Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I'd like to see you again in eight weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 370.75,
      "end_seconds": 373.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I can put that appointment in for you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.48,
      "end_seconds": 377.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Alright, I'll see you out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.71,
      "end_seconds": 384.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 386.25,
      "end_seconds": 386.95,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Goodbye."
    }
  ]
}